**Original skins:
**:[[Scout]]: {{Color|Basic|Red}}, {{Color|Basic|Green}}, {{Color|Basic|Blue}}
**:[[Soldier]]: {{Color|Basic|Red}}, {{Color|Basic|Blue}}
