**3 new skins.
**:[[Ace Pilot]]: {{Color|Basic|Red}}, {{Color|Basic|Green}}, {{Color|Basic|Yellow}}
*'''8 December 2019''' - [[Release v1.4|Release v1.4.1]]
**4 skins moved from [[Premium Crate]].
**:[[Scout]]: {{Color|Basic|Survivor}}, {{Color|Basic|Black Ops}}
**:[[Sniper]]: {{Color|Basic|Ghillie}}
**:[[Minigunner]]: {{Color|Basic|Black Ops}}
*'''12 January 2020''' - [[Release v1.6|Release v1.6.0]]
**10 new skins.
**:[[Pyromancer]]: {{Color|Basic|Blue}}
**:[[Paintballer]]: {{Color|Basic|Red}}
**:[[Crook Boss]]: {{Color|Basic|Blue}}, {{Color|Basic|Red}}
**:[[Ranger]]: {{Color|Basic|Blue}}, {{Color|Basic|Green}}, {{Color|Basic|Black Ops}}
**:[[Hunter]]: {{Color|Basic|Blue}}
**:[[Commander]]: {{Color|Basic|Red}}, {{Color|Basic|Green}}
*'''29 October 2020''' - [[Overhaul v1.0|Overhaul v1.0.0]]
**'''Basic Crate''' can now give the player duplicate skins, after every skin was unlocked.
**Skins can now appear in the daily skin store.
**Skin rarity added, though it only affects the cost of skins in the daily skin store.
**Crate opening music added.
**3 skins moved to [[Premium Crate]]:
**:[[Scout]]: {{Color|Premium|Black Ops}}
**:[[Ranger]]: {{Color|Premium|Black Ops}}
**:[[Minigunner]]: {{Color|Premium|Black Ops}}
**3 new skins.
**:[[Ace Pilot]]: {{Color|Basic|Aerial Ace}}, {{Color|Basic|Purple}}, {{Color|Basic|Navy}}
*'''21 December 2022''' - [[v1.6.0]]
**'''Basic Crate''' can no longer be opened after every skin has been unlocked.
**Skin rarity now affects how likely you are to unlock a skin.
**Skin rarities changed.
***{{Color|Basic|Ghillie}} [[Sniper]] skin rarity changed from {{Color|Uncommon}} to {{Color|Common}}.
***{{Color|Basic|Survivor}} [[Scout]]/[[Golden Scout]] skin rarity changed from {{Color|Uncommon}} to {{Color|Rare}}.
***{{Color|Basic|Navy}} [[Ace Pilot]] skin rarity changed from {{Color|Uncommon}} to {{Color|Common}}.
***{{Color|Basic|Aerial Ace}} [[Ace Pilot]] skin rarity changed from {{Color|Rare}} to {{Color|Common}}.
**{{Color|Uncommon}} skin cost in the daily skin store decreased from {{Coins|1,600}} to {{Coins|1,500}}.
**{{Color|Rare}} skin cost in the daily skin store decreased from {{Coins|2,500}} to {{Coins|2,000}}.
**1 new skin.
**:[[Demoman]]: {{Color|Basic|Military}}
**{{Bug}} Crate opening music no longer plays.
*'''23 January 2023''' - [[v1.6.0]]
**{{Color|Basic|Navy}} [[Ace Pilot]] skin rarity changed from {{Color|Common}} to {{Color|Rare}}.
*'''5 May 2023''' - [[v1.7.2]]
**{{Color|Basic|Military}} [[Demoman]] skin rarity changed from {{Color|Rare}} to {{Color|Uncommon}}.
**4 new skins.
**:[[Demoman]]: {{Color|Basic|Red}}, {{Color|Basic|Yellow}}
**:[[Accelerator]]: {{Color|Basic|Navy}}, {{Color|Basic|Red}}
*'''24 June 2023''' - [[v1.8.2]]
**Cost decreased from {{Coins|1,000}} to {{Coins|500}}.
*'''28 October 2023''' - [[v1.9.0]]
**{{Bugfix}} Crate opening music now plays.
*'''22 April 2026''' - [[v1.89.0]]
**Appearance changed.
**Icon changed.
*'''21 August 2026''' - [[v2.7.0]]
**{{Color|Common}} rarity added.
**{{Color|Common}} skin cost in the daily skin store decreased from {{Coins|1,250}} to {{Coins|500}}.
**{{Color|Uncommon}} skin cost in the daily skin store decreased from {{Coins|1,500}} to {{Coins|750}}.
**{{Color|Rare}} skin cost in the daily skin store decreased from {{Coins|2,000}} to {{Coins|1,000}}.
**{{Color|Legendary}} skin cost in the daily skin store increased from {{Coins|4,000}} to {{Coins|99,999}}.
